<title>USA: Response USA suspends prfrd shr conversion.</title>
<headline>Response USA suspends prfrd shr conversion.</headline>
<dateline>LAWRENCEVILLE, N.J. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Response USA Inc said on Monday that it has suspended conversion of its 1996 Series A convertible preferred stock because of recent, unusual trading activity in its common stock.</p>
<p>The company also noted &quot;substantial conversions&quot; of its 1996 preferred stock dated June 28 and said it issued the suspension pending a full investigation into the trading.</p>
<p>The company said it will take &quot;whatever action is required&quot; to protect shareholder interest, including the possible renegotiation of the terms and conditions of the preferred stock.</p>
</text>
